# Line endings for files Linux has to execute.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites
# checked-out files to CRLF. A shell script with CRLF endings fails inside a
# container with a misleading "no such file or directory" — the kernel is
# reporting the shebang "/bin/sh\r", not the script itself.
#
# Scoped deliberately to the files that matter, rather than a repo-wide
# `* text=auto eol=lf`, which would renormalise every tracked file and bury the
# next commit in whitespace changes.

*.sh                 text eol=lf
docker-entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile           text eol=lf
.dockerignore        text eol=lf
*.yaml               text eol=lf
*.yml                text eol=lf

# Never line-ending-convert binary assets.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db    binary